{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"7799","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v1266","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"西崎えいむ","creatorId":"vndb:s15347","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3564","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15347","name":"西崎えいむ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:18800","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"阿風梨々亜","creatorId":"vndb:s805","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:395","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s805","name":"阿風梨々亜","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:21055","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"シナリオ制作チームさるさる","creatorId":"egs:creator:5656","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5656","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:5656","name":"シナリオ制作チームさるさる","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:273061","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"Corey&Carter","creatorId":"vndb:s2994","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5071","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2994","name":"Corey&Carter","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:20164","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"薬師 るり","creatorId":"vndb:s2361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2361","name":"薬師 るり","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:22279","source":"vndb"}],"other":[{"creditedName":"薬師るり","creatorId":"vndb:s2361","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:5042","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2361","name":"薬師るり","detail":"OP曲「Precious word ～君につたえたい～」、ED曲「いつの冬も」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:147260","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"KIZAWA studio(株式会社KIZAWA studio、キザワスタジオ)","creatorId":"vndb:s592","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:13068","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s592","name":"KIZAWA studio(株式会社KIZAWA studio、キザワスタジオ)","detail":"OP、デモムービー","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:70204","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"KIZAWA studio","creatorId":"vndb:s592","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s592","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s592","name":"KIZAWA studio","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:22277","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"薬師 るり","creatorId":"vndb:s2361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2361","name":"薬師 るり","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:22280","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c949","characterName":"金田遥","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154422","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21863"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25382"],"vndbCharacterId":"c949"},"originalCharacterName":"金田遥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruka and Hidenori are contemporaries, and have grown up together. She has the habit of calling him \"Hide-chan\", though has recently been trying to break out of that in order to sound more adult-like. Despite being opinionated, Haruka is a very accommodating person, and likes Hidenori enough that she will put up with him from time to time. Of course, there have been a good number of times where Haruka has lost her temper, though willfully drops such subjects very quickly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c949"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼なじみ。見かけによらず結構ドジで、運動神経も鈍い。気弱だが芯は強く負けず嫌い。主人公と対等な関係になりたいと願っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大城家と金田家はご近所同士で、家族ぐるみの付き合い。その流れで主人公と付き合いだすが、関係ははっきりしない。遥の***卒業と同時に、金田家は東京に転居するが、付き合いは変わらず続いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"東京封鎖時、東京の実家に戻っていたため主人公と引き離される。現在の消息は不明。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25382","sourceWorkId":"7799","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/4975893eb4598db06e0265e457d56a41a3b0b67809052311ca4bf4f4b85ad613.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4ad0d671c82a2c44e85e2a2ed51915c7bca815fdb3a368507f81ed01fd2ed582.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平山ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s285","name":"平山 ゆかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21863:154422:5905:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c951","characterName":"金田未来","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154423","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21863"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25383"],"vndbCharacterId":"c951"},"originalCharacterName":"金田未来","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miku is Haruka's younger sister. She starts out looking at our protagonist as an older brother, and as such doesn't hesitate to be playful with him. Of course, Miku eventually develops a bit of a crush on him, but keeps it to herself out of respect for her sister. For the most part, she acts like a representative of her sister, making sure that Hidenori remains faithful to her while waiting for the day when the blockade will come down."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c951"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"遥の妹。おっとりした姉とは対照的に、言うことはきちんと言いすぎるほど言ってしまうしっかり者＆ちゃっかり者。打算的な小悪魔タイプで、欲望に対し心底正直。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の両親と仲が良く、彼らにとっては娘のような存在。主人公にとっては生意気な妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"封鎖前日、大城家に泊りがけで遊びに来ており、そのまま自分の両親＆姉と引き離されてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"封鎖後、大城家に居候し千葉の学園に進学。封鎖前日に借りた姉の携帯を今でも持ち続けている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25383","sourceWorkId":"7799","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98c0dacc6a3e9b5032495eb5be0dab5ab876487ed73142f86420be5c419b3ea3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/3900c0e7394d018638e766848237d642eb5577f66aebb7b1383dc86e1092243d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田佳代","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21863:154423:6038:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c952","characterName":"島森茜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154425","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21863"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25384"],"vndbCharacterId":"c952"},"originalCharacterName":"島森茜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akane is a mutual friend of Haruka and Hidenori's. The three of them grew up together, though later Akane ends up taking the role of mediator whenever Hide and Haruka would have a fight. Like many others, she has a family member that is stuck in Tokyo (her father). In hopes of being able to get on the inside of things, Akane joins the national guard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though she initially sees Hidenori as a good friend, Akane starts to develop feelings for him over the two years that the barricade is up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c952"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と遥とは中学時代からの親友。ボーイッシュで元気がとりえ。さばさばとして明るく、行動力がある。趣味は主人公をからかうこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に好意を持っていたが、遥と付き合いだしたと聞いて身を引いた。以来主人公とは性別を超えた友人。「東京封鎖」時、東京の商社勤めだった父親と引き離される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後主人公とともに政府の対応に苛立ちを感じていたが、突如自衛隊に入隊。主人公たちの住む街の封鎖線を守る部隊に配属され、再会を果たす。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25384","sourceWorkId":"7799","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b499a9ce7030c97c669589e07dbffc0e7c9a6a74266619ac60d1bb4c793d3b7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c62de01aa51e0777ab11ecd076c83adb73fa6d8ef2971960fa4ec99633c786e4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加藤雅美","creatorId":"vndb:s656","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s656","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s656","name":"加藤 雅美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21863:154425:13773:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c953","characterName":"ナオミ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154424","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21863"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25385"],"vndbCharacterId":"c953"},"originalCharacterName":"ナオミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Naomi is introduced as an acquaintance of Hidenori's boss, Kouba Yashi. Not much is revealed about this mysterious woman for a good part of the story, though she proves to have a large number of information sources, knowledge in combat and familiarity with covert ops missions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Moroboshi Yuumei's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c953"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"東京侵入を計る女。国籍等不明。外見は日本人に見え、日本語も流暢だが、外国語にも堪能な様子。「東京封鎖」の謎に関わっているらしく、主人公の東京侵入のきっかけになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこか悲しげな瞳と、達観に満ちた表情が印象的。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25385","sourceWorkId":"7799","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5dc522924b07f7f9eb4eb2ebcdac1e17ae3b383e98b7cb41d234e3188835f5a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a13cd7358a497d4de8f012b6edfac3ed46bf5a9b9a563991b7f8a1c5c72d8bfa.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21863:154424:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c950","characterName":"大城秀典","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c950"},"originalCharacterName":"大城秀典","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2cf4d58922c3400728c4c6eaeede333e7cdfb539177dcdad21b8ab4ec119b72.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/024798a88a243c645a6fa036cdbd76a53ea928a4ad8509ff33601ca63b0f6bd5.webp","width":242,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p167","sourceCompanyId